  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Protection, Assistance et Solutions</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responding to urgent needs of affected communities in Northern and Central Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">La fourniture d&apos;une protection efficace, d&apos;une assistance et de solutions durables aux r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, aux personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es &#xe0; l&apos;int&#xe9;rieur de leur propre pays (PDI) et aux autres victimes de conflits et de catastrophes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this award is to provide financial support to iom for a program entitled responding to urgent needs of affected communities in northern and central Mali in Mali. The program outcomes are: outcome 1: improved living conditions of vulnerable households among internally displaced persons and host communities and enhanced shelter coordination outcome 2: humanitarian and national partners in Mali have reinforced access to accurate and up-to-date data on population displacements and needs analysis is strengthened through a reliable database.</narrative>
  </description>
